        <body>
            <div xml:id="d6">

                <pb facs="0143" n="7" sameAs="frus:frus1929v01/pg7"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">500.C114/762: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Geneva</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Rand</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                            Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Geneva</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-03-07T09:00:00+01:00">March 7, 1929—9
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received 9:25 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>From Root. Do not trouble about authority. I think I have arranged for referring
                    proposal of 1926 conference to Committee of Experts thus giving them the whole
                    subject for consideration.</p>
                <p>Should be glad of any information about situation in Washington.</p>
                <closer><signed>
                        <list>
                            <item>[Root]</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rand</hi></item>
                        </list>
                    </signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
